title Cassette Bluetooth (T9, synthetic names): the chosen headset is not connected (B27): the empty window says so in its two-line style ("The Bluetooth headset is not connected." over the muted "Found by itself when it connects."), never the USB text; the strip (landscape) has the controller's text, the info box (portrait, square) its short form "Not connected" on one line inside the box; REC dimmed
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT notconnected
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "The Bluetooth headset is not connected."
expect text "Found by itself when it connects."
expect notext "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect notext "Found by itself when plugged in."
@320x480 expect text "Not connected"
@480x800 expect text "Not connected"
@480x480 expect text "Not connected"
@720x720 expect text "Not connected"
expect text "BT"
shot rec-notconnected
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
